Upstream bug: with forward_traceparent_to_llm_provider enabled,
provider spans bypass LiteLLM's model-call span.

https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/issues/39067

Replace the inbound traceparent at the provider handoff with the model-call
span context.

Removal check: tests/verify_tracing.py

